{
  "name": "FuturePath_OUTRO",
  "script": [
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "5ds_duelinghighway",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Yusei's monsters are working together to win. It's like they have a bond - the same bond Team 5D's has."
    },
    {
      "char": "crowhogan",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "So as long as our bond stays strong, no matter where in the world we are, we'll always be together! I now know what I want to do with my life!"
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Me too!"
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Ditto!"
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Same here!"
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "crowhogan",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Jack! Our duel has taught me what I want to do!"
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "So you've found your path."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "I'm going to stay in New Domino City!"
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Yusei... I see..."
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Very well. You've now given me a reason to come back to this city in the future. Because I refuse to end my career with a loss on my record."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Come back anytime. I'll be waiting."
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Then you'll be waiting to lose!"
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Yusei!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Everyone!"
    },
    {
      "char": "crowhogan",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "laughter",
      "text": "I've decided to join the pro league, Yusei!"
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "And I'm going to study to be a doctor!"
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "And we'll go live with our parents! But I'll write you every week!"
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "It'll be nice to get a home-cooked meal!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "That's great. You've each found your own path. But no matter how far apart we are, our bond is forever!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "crowhogan",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "5ds_citysquare",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "This city holds a lot of memories."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Yeah. I'll never forget this place."
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "goodnightssleep",
      "text": "Leo, you've changed."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Really?"
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "You used to be a crybaby, but now I can count on you when times get tough."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "shy",
      "text": "Oh yeah?"
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Yeah. You've really grown up."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Well, I had to! Who else would protect my baby sister?"
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Who are you calling baby?"
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "5ds_arena",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Carly!"
    },
    {
      "char": "carlycarmine",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "glasses_shy",
      "text": "H-How did you know I was here? Anyway, you don't mind if I join you on your trip, do you?"
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "Of course I mind! My goal is to become the top duelist in the world! And I can't have any distractions!"
    },
    {
      "char": "carlycarmine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "glasses_discouragement",
      "text": "Jack…"
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "The next time you see me, I'll be King of the world! Farewell!"
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "carlycarmine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "glasses_surprise",
      "text": "\"The next time you see me...\" That means he wants to see me!"
    },
    {
      "char": "carlycarmine",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "5ds_yuseihome",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Akiza?"
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "Yusei, I guess you're the only one staying here."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Yeah. Your flight is tomorrow, right?"
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "normal2",
      "text": "It is. And I wanted to make sure I said goodbye to you, Yusei."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "shy",
      "text": "Yusei… I just wanted to tell you that I… I.."
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "shy2",
      "text": "I'm happy that I got to know you."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "shy",
      "text": "Me too, Akiza."
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "goodnightssleep",
      "text": "When I first met you, I thought you were kinda scary."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "I'M scary? You're the one who was known as the Black Rose Witch! You should see yourself when you glare. I didn't know what you'd do to me if I lost."
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "What? You thought that?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "goodnightssleep",
      "text": "But on the other hand, your smile is the greatest in the world."
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "And you're the one who put the smile on my face, Yusei."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "shy2",
      "text": "Well... Bye..."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Good luck."
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "5ds_citysquare",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "On the final night before Yusei's friends leave to head their separate ways, Yusei looked over New Domino City - the city they all helped to protect."
    },
    {
      "char": "tetsutrudge",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Hey! What's this suspicious-looking fella doin' here!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Trudge!"
    },
    {
      "char": "tetsutrudge",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "I heard everyone is leaving tomorrow. You good?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "I hate to see them go. But I would hate it more if they didn't chase their dreams."
    },
    {
      "char": "tetsutrudge",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "You think you'll all stay friends?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Of course. We have a bond. An unbreakable bond. A bond that will only get stronger."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "We're each heading towards the next stage in our lives, and I can't wait to see where it takes us."
    },
    {
      "char": "tetsutrudge",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Heh! Since when did you get so philosophical?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "In my duel against Jack, I realized that my soul is tied to this city."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "So when my friends come back someday, I have to make sure New Domino City is a place they're proud to call home."
    },
    {
      "char": "tetsutrudge",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "5ds_duelinghighway",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Okay, everyone! This is Team 5D's last ride! So let's rev it up!"
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "When I return, I'll be the true King!"
    },
    {
      "char": "crowhogan",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "laughter",
      "text": "Unless I'm the King!"
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "New Domino City! I'll never forget ya!"
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "You'll always be my home!"
    },
    {
      "char": "akizaizinski",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "This isn't goodbye. This is 'til we meet again!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Our future lies ahead of us on this road. So let's live it to the fullest!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Ready! Set! Duel!"
    }
  ]
}
